
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#e73528">
<title>Support SmashCheck</title>

<style>
:root {
  --red: #e73528;
  --dark-red: #b82118;
  --black: #111;
  --bg: #f6f4ef;
  --border: #dedad2;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--black);
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
}

main {
  width: min(900px, 100%);
  margin: auto;
  padding: 35px 20px 55px;
}

header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 3rem);
  font-weight: 1000;
  letter-spacing: -3px;
}

header span {
  color: var(--red);
}

.logo {
  width: 55px;
  height: 55px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 13px;
}

.hero {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 7vw, 3.5rem);
  letter-spacing: -2px;
  line-height: 1.05;
  margin: 0 0 15px;
}

.hero h1 span {
  color: var(--red);
}

.hero p {
  max-width: 540px;
  margin: auto;
  color: #625e58;
  line-height: 1.6;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
}

.optional {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 18px;
  padding: 7px 13px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: #fbe2df;
  color: var(--dark-red);
  font-size: .8rem;
  font-weight: 850;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.tiers {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
}

.tier {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 22px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 15px #11108;
}

.tier-icon {
  height: 105px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: #fff0ee;
  border-radius: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 17px;
  font-size: 3.5rem;
}

.tier h2 {
  margin: 0 0 7px;
  font-size: 1.2rem;
}

.price {
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 1000;
  margin: 8px 0 17px;
}

.tier a {
  display: block;
  padding: 14px 10px;
  background: var(--red);
  color: white;
  border-radius: 11px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 900;
  transition: background .2s, transform .2s;
}

.tier a:hover {
  background: var(--dark-red);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.no-pressure {
  text-align: center;
  margin: 32px auto;
  max-width: 550px;
  color: #625e58;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.back-button {
  display: block;
  width: fit-content;
  margin: 30px auto 0;
  padding: 14px 23px;
  border: 2px solid var(--black);
  border-radius: 12px;
  color: var(--black);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.back-button:hover {
  background: var(--black);
  color: white;
}

footer {
  margin-top: 45px;
  padding-top: 20px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  text-align: center;
  color: #77716b;
  font-size: .78rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

@media (max-width: 580px) {
  main {
    padding: 25px 14px 40px;
  }

  .tiers {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 13px;
  }

  .tier {
    padding: 17px;
  }

  .tier-icon {
    height: 85px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<main>

<header>
  <img
    class="logo"
    src="ChatGPT%20Image%20Oct%2030,%202026,%2005_34_32%20PM.jpg"
    alt="SmashCheck logo"
  >
  Smash<span>Check</span>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Keep the <span>good vibes</span> going.</h1>

  <p>
    SmashCheck is free to use. If you enjoy the project
    and want to help support its development, you can
    leave an optional tip below.
  </p>

  <div class="optional">100% optional · No pressure</div>
</section>

<section class="tiers">

  <article class="tier">
    <div class="tier-icon">🎩</div>
    <h2>Gentleman</h2>
    <div class="price">$2</div>
    <a href="YOUR_GENTLEMAN_STRIPE_LINK"
       target="_blank"
       rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Leave a $2 Tip
    </a>
  </article>

  <article class="tier">
    <div class="tier-icon">😎</div>
    <h2>Tool</h2>
    <div class="price">$5</div>
    <a href="YOUR_TOOL_STRIPE_LINK"
       target="_blank"
       rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Leave a $5 Tip
    </a>
  </article>

  <article class="tier">
    <div class="tier-icon">🐴</div>
    <h2>Rising Stud</h2>
    <div class="price">$20</div>
    <a href="YOUR_RISING_STUD_STRIPE_LINK"
       target="_blank"
       rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Leave a $20 Tip
    </a>
  </article>

  <article class="tier">
    <div class="tier-icon">🦍</div>
    <h2>Big "D" Energy</h2>
    <div class="price">$50</div>
    <a href="YOUR_BIG_D_ENERGY_STRIPE_LINK"
       target="_blank"
       rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Leave a $50 Tip
    </a>
  </article>

</section>

<p class="no-pressure">
  Not tipping? No problem at all. SmashCheck remains
  completely free, and your experience is exactly the same.
</p>

<a class="back-button" href="index.html">
  ← Back to SmashCheck
</a>

<footer>
  Voluntary contributions support the SmashCheck project.
  They are not charitable donations or tax-deductible gifts.
  Payments are processed securely by Stripe.
  <br><br>
  © 2026 SmashCheck
</footer>

</main>
</body>
</html>
